{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/README.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:31:40.759924Z","id":"30a57b9ef8955e23ff37b8e58bfe540fddaa63970a06cc0d5bcbdea2a8cb215e","body":{"detail":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip has no project.json, so assert_proofs! and jarl/scripts/verify.sh never check it; only build.sh does. step_vote is closed, but the other seven step message kinds (StepCase_<kind>.lean from gen/step_cases.py) still end in sorry, and next_message, build, the world simulation and the implementation-level election-safety theorem are not started. It also covers only the fixed engine (Fixed: hooks absent, peers equal to members).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":26},"end":{"line":29},"content_hash":"2406a25a558e437bdeaa581c34078808f306c08c8710bc833153a6f7e9f9bada"},"suggested_fix":"Close the remaining step cases and their Abs lemmas, prove next_message/build, compose a world simulation onto Jarl.ElectionSafety.Step, then add a project.json with proof_modules so the gate checks it and drop the -wip suffix.","summary":"The Node refinement is ungated and covers only the Vote arm of step","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/README.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-03T16:46:00.734932Z","id":"9b7bed00596a7d0698fde16c56f778901fcc5e1c7fb4589f0fd4364b8092e62f","body":{"detail":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip has no project.json, so assert_proofs! and jarl/scripts/verify.sh never check it; only build.sh does. step_spec (Step.lean) now covers every message kind and AbsStep.lean maps each StepOut arm to a model step, but next_message and build have no specs, nothing composes tick_spec/step_spec/Abs into Jarl.ElectionSafety.Step sequences (the world simulation), and the implementation-level election-safety theorem is not stated. It also covers only the fixed engine (Fixed: hooks absent, peers equal to members).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":27},"end":{"line":30},"content_hash":"e9d88489f3268a5c1711c7c94502384274b3ed07917fe7a1be82fa8324703cd3"},"suggested_fix":"Prove next_message/build, compose a world simulation onto Jarl.ElectionSafety.Step, then add a project.json with proof_modules so the gate checks it and drop the -wip suffix.","summary":"The Node refinement is ungated; step is complete, but next_message, build and the world simulation are not","supersedes":"30a57b9ef8955e23ff37b8e58bfe540fddaa63970a06cc0d5bcbdea2a8cb215e","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/README.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-04T03:25:20.112755Z","id":"e6ada668625188dfa4a85b0bfc80d6c01ea0eaa670560c24ef5de3c809654aa8","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:bc556db","summary":"Fixed: bc556db adds jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/project.json, so assert_proofs! and verify.sh check the refinement; next_spec, build_spec, Sim.lean and node_election_safety complete it. verify-methods on the project passes every module under PROVIUM_LEAN_MEMORY_MB=8192 (peak RSS 7.0 GB, 14.5 min); the reshaped Sim.lean then passes the obligation audit for Refine.node_election_safety. The remaining scope (fixed engine only) is recorded on Sim.lean.","supersedes":"9b7bed00596a7d0698fde16c56f778901fcc5e1c7fb4589f0fd4364b8092e62f","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/Sim.lean","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-04T03:25:20.112885Z","id":"195c1303037b60a02c3d04419906ad95a9ff982cffe030694752c05581b379b1","body":{"detail":"Act and Initial require membership hooks absent and every node built by Node::build with membershipv ids (not derived from Node::new or Membership::new), and Act.deliver takes envelopes of the form envelopev src dst m for some Msg, so payload shapes (e.g. a Replicated rejection being a Rej value) are assumed rather than derived from the sender. Dynamic membership (the hook engine, joint configurations, learners) is not covered; CORRECTNESS_PLAN.md S11-S14 (M4) remain open.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":46},"end":{"line":80},"content_hash":"68274877524d66d468f9f1b6f517f161f00de998c02b48e100a12151946d5438"},"suggested_fix":"Derive membershipv ids from Node::new's Membership::new call; relate delivered payloads to the sender's outbox descriptors through typed Lean mirrors (see provium/docs/typed-backend.md); extend the model and simulation to the hook engine for M4.","summary":"node_election_safety covers only the fixed engine and assumes a stable configuration and well-formed message payloads","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/project.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:23.933810Z","id":"021d4d40f0a647a3f9dbc170249d128f849edf8de902c9e5e99054541686ee9a","body":{"detail":"jarl/proofs/engine/Engine/Main.lean proves election_safety for the fixed Node over the typed translation of the full bodies, which is the claim node-refinement-wip's node_election_safety makes over the deep embedding. Keeping both doubles maintenance of two translations.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":1},"end":{"line":1},"content_hash":"a9c15fc199fb1090f4b19d8fec19e728800d8d458e0ecf0ab1b3b0592721d0cb"},"suggested_fix":"Retire node-refinement-wip once the engine project is gated in CI, recording in PROGRESS.md that S02 for the fixed engine is carried by jarl/proofs/engine.","summary":"The M2 node-refinement project is superseded by jarl/proofs/engine","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/Sim.lean","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-05T02:55:53.186508Z","id":"8395339b163501f746b3b3868be350660be5716503af3d94b5d09c9c3946b501","body":{"kind":"resolve","summary":"Obsolete: node-refinement-wip is retired. Its claim (fixed-engine election safety) is carried by jarl/proofs/engine Engine/Main.lean election_safety over the typed translation of the full bodies, verified with 537 obligations on host and wasm32; the dynamic engine remains open (recorded on jarl/proofs/engine/README.md).","supersedes":"195c1303037b60a02c3d04419906ad95a9ff982cffe030694752c05581b379b1","tags":["reason:obsolete","session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/project.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-05T02:55:53.219822Z","id":"30d4ccb1b9108cabee54b930cae055ab2dc6aeaaae88206582da02e241bb34e2","body":{"kind":"resolve","summary":"Done: node-refinement-wip is retired with the other deep-embedding projects; jarl/proofs/engine carries its claims.","supersedes":"021d4d40f0a647a3f9dbc170249d128f849edf8de902c9e5e99054541686ee9a","tags":["reason:obsolete","session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
